8. Evidence & reporting - [completed]:{Findings: Archived evidence including crafted PCAP(s), shell session logs, payloads, and captured flags. Documented key vulnerabilities and remediation recommendations: sanitize/validate uploaded filenames and arguments, avoid invoking shell-sensitive utilities with attacker-controlled input (or use safe APIs), store hashed passwords instead of plaintext in SQLite, and remove/restrict unsafe sudo rules allowing tcpdump with writable wildcards.}

